WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
Our lineage and our legacy hails back to Athens, to Rome,

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.240
to Philadelphia, to Monticello.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.400
Our ancestors built the cities.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.920
They produced the art and architecture.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.520
They built the industry.

